              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Domestic incorporation supplies a corporate-law reference, not the location of every asset or obligor.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C262",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Do not substitute corporate domicile for guarantor jurisdiction or legal perimeter.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C262",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ],
          "style": "row"
        },
        {
          "row_id": "r1",
          "label": "Sector — Documentary Fact",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "Aerospace components, including defense applications. K pages 4–6 describe component offerings and end markets.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C263",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Aviation production, fleet activity and procurement budgets transmit demand to earnings.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C263",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Analyze those demand channels rather than treating end-market labels as protection.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C263",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ],
          "style": "row"
        },
        {
          "row_id": "r2",
          "label": "Listing and ownership class — Documentary Fact",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "K page:1 lists common stock, trading symbol TDG, on the New York Stock Exchange.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C264",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Public common equity identifies a shareholder class and reporting framework, not beneficial control or willingness to provide support.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C264",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "No private-equity sponsor, controlling holder or support commitment is inferred.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C264",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ],
          "style": "row"
        },
        {
          "row_id": "r3",
          "label": "Parent/subsidiary ownership — Documentary Fact",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "K page:4: TD Group “holds all of the outstanding capital stock of TransDigm Inc.” Consolidated references also include controlled wholly-owned and majority-owned subsidiaries.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C265",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Parent and operating issuer are distinct entities; cash transfer and guarantee arrangements determine creditor access to resources.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C265",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Preserve parent-versus-operating-issuer identity; consolidated cash and earnings are not automatically the obligor's unrestricted resources.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C265",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ],
          "style": "row"
        },
        {
          "row_id": "r4",
          "label": "Control, economic interests and prior owners — Insufficient Information",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "K page:79 says beneficial ownership details “will be set forth” in the incorporated proxy. That proxy is not supplied. Controller, holder economic interests, voting arrangements and prior ownership sequence: Not supplied.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C266",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Missing ownership/control terms prevent analysis of shareholder concentration, consent influence and external support incentives.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C266",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "No percentages or sponsor identity inferred. Obtain the relevant dated proxy and ownership history before making control/alignment claims.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C266",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ],
          "style": "row"
        },
        {
