          "label": "Debt issuer and guarantee summary — Documentary Fact",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "K page:151: “TransDigm Inc., as issuer, TransDigm Group and the other subsidiaries of TransDigm Inc. named therein, as guarantors.” The filing describes secured guarantees and structural subordination to non-guarantor liabilities.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C267",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Guarantee coverage and non-guarantor assets affect creditor access; issuance summary is not an executed legal perimeter.",
              "prov": "cited",
              "ref_id": "C267",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Use CP-1's filing-reported capital-structure register; no independent ranking, capacity or recovery outcome is concluded.",
