              "ref_id": "C268",
              "gap_ref": null,
              "unit_class": "text",
              "state": "known"
            },
            {
              "text": "Monitor acquisition funding, integration cash costs and acquired earnings; management's value-creation claim is not adopted and realized synergies are not assumed.",
