          "label": "Financial scale and debt-service foundation — Documentary Fact",
          "cells": [
            {
              "text": "Reference CP-1, Financials and credit metrics: annual net sales, operating EBIT, EBITDA, EBITDA As Defined, CFO, capex, gross/carrying debt, coverage and conversion; underlying K pages 71, 120–123 and 144–145.",
